<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46091" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζᾰμεν-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μένος</span>) poet. Adj.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>very strong, mighty, raging,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				h.Merc.
				307
			</span></i> (in 
				Sup.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζαμενέστατε</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">;
				Κένταυρος, ἅλιος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				9.38
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>N.</u>
				4.13
			</span></i>, cf. <u>Sammelb.</u>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				5829.8
			</span></i>: once in Trag., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζ. λόγος</span>
			word <i>of violence</i> or <i>enmity</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				137
			</span></i> (anap.); also in late 
				Ep.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζ. χόλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>C.</u>
					3.448
				</span></i>
			: neut. as Adv., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ ζαμενὲς κοτέουσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					181
				</span></i>
			:—in form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζᾰμενός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, Orac. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Plot.</u>
				22
			</span></i> codd., <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
